 via BFS","target":"116.Bipartite check — 2-colouring via BFS","line":18},{"title":"117.Dijkstra's algorithm — O((V+E) log V) with min-heap","target":"117.Dijkstra's algorithm — O((V+E) log V) with min-heap","line":22},{"title":"118.Bellman-Ford — negative weights, negative cycle detection","target":"118.Bellman-Ford — negative weights, negative cycle detection","line":23},{"title":"119.Floyd-Warshall — all-pairs shortest paths, O(V^3)","target":"119.Floyd-Warshall — all-pairs shortest paths, O(V^3)","line":24},{"title":"120.0-1 BFS — deque-based BFS for 0 1 edge weights","target":"120.0-1 BFS — deque-based BFS for 0 1 edge weights","line":25},{"title":"121.Topological sort — Kahn's algorithm (BFS-based)","target":"121.Topological sort — Kahn's algorithm (BFS-based)","line":29},{"title":"122.Topological sort — DFS-based with finish times","target":"122.Topological sort — DFS-based with finish times","line":30},{"title":"123.Dependency resolution — ML computation graph connection","target":"123.Dependency resolution — ML computation graph connection","line":31},{"title":"124.Course schedule problems — detecting cycles in DAGs","target":"124.Course schedule problems — detecting cycles in DAGs","line":32},{"title":"125.Kruskal's algorithm — sort edges, Union-Find","target":"125.Kruskal's algorithm — sort edges, Union-Find","line":36},{"title":"126.Prim's algorithm — greedy, priority queue","target":"126.Prim's algorithm — greedy, priority queue","line":37},{"title":"127.MST in clustering — single-linkage hierarchical clustering connection","target":"127.MST in clustering — single-linkage hierarchical clustering connection","line":38},{"title":"128.Union-Find — union by rank and path compression","target":"128.Union-Find — union by rank and path compression","line":42},{"title":"129.Detecting cycles with Union-Find","target":"129.Detecting cycles with Union-Find","line":43},{"title":"130.Connected components with Union-Find","target":"130.Connected components with Union